7. Split text into manageable, overlapping chunks.
8. Preserve document name, chunk index, page number when available, and other useful metadata.
9. Generate embeddings for the chunks.
10. Persist the embeddings in the vector index.
11. Save document-processing metadata in the database.
12. Return a clear status to the frontend.
